  "document": "Hans Zimmer\nHans Florian Zimmer (] ; born 12 September 1957) is a German film score composer and record producer. Since the 1980s, he has composed music for over 150 films. His works include \"The Lion King\", for which he won the Academy Award for Best Original Score in 1995, the \"Pirates of the Caribbean\" series, \"The Thin Red Line\", \"Gladiator\", \"The Last Samurai\", \"The Dark Knight Trilogy\", \"Inception\", \"Interstellar\" and \"Dunkirk\"."
